    "title": "Amanda Brouwer: Leading Old Saybrook's America 250 Effort - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eric O'Connell ,\n15 hours ago Amanda Brouwer is helping lead Old Saybrook’s America 250 celebration, organizing events to mark the nation’s 250th anniversary in 2026. — Old Saybrook will join other local communities in 2026 in celebrating the 250th anniversary of the signing of the Declaration of Independence. In Old Saybrook, those efforts are being led by Amanda Brouwer, director of the Acton Public Library. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
